摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Local visual editor for existing HTML, with interactive previews and AI collaboration. Available as a DeepSeek Harness plugin and agent skill. 本地 HTML 可视化编辑、交互预览与 AI 协作，支持 DeepSeek Harness 插件和 Agent Skill。","id":"gh:1331175545","install_available":false,"language":"HTML","name":"html-workbench","slug":"alienzhou/html-workbench","topics":["agent-skills","ai-collaboration","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","grapesjs","html-editor","local-first","visual-editor","wysiwyg"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Local visual editor for existing HTML, with interactive previews and AI collaboration. Available as "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"a DeepSeek Harness plugin and agent skill. 本地 HTML 可视化编辑、交互预览与 AI 协作，支持 DeepSeek Harness 插件和 Agent S"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"pSeek Harness plugin and agent skill. 本地 HTML 可视化编辑、交互预览与 AI 协作，支持 DeepSeek Harness 插件和 Agent Skill。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# HTML Workbench"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Turn an existing HTML page into a local workspace where people can edit it visually, preview its int"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"eractions, and save changes back to disk."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The workflow is simple: create a page with the tool you prefer, refine copy, images, layout, and sty"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ling directly in the browser, then switch to Preview to test buttons, links, and page behavior. Both"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" people and AI continue to work from the same HTML source file."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **HTML Workbench is not an HTML generator.** Create HTML however you prefer—with any AI, design to"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ol, template, or hand-written code—then give that file to HTML Workbench. It turns the existing docu"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ment into a visual editor with preview and real-time collaboration against the same source file."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## DeepSeek Harness plugin"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"HTML Workbench is also a first-class plugin for DeepSeek Harness — the agent harness this tooling pl"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ugs into — published as `@vibe-x/dsh-html-workbench`. DeepSeek Harness ships a built-in plugin syste"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"m, and this plugin brings the visual editor straight into its web UI's right sidebar: no separate br"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"owser window and no manual `open` command."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"As the agent creates or edits `.html` files (through the `write` / `edit` tools), the panel tracks t"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"hem automatically. Open one to edit copy, images, layout, and styles in the embedded GrapesJS editor"},{"id":"p9s3","text":", switch to **Preview** to test interactions, then **Save** to write the result back to the same sou"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"to **Preview** to test interactions, then **Save** to write the result back to the same source file."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Prerequisites: DeepSeek Harness installed and `dsh web` running, Node.js ≥ 20, and Python 3.9+."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` and hard-refresh the browser (Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+R). A trigger button appears in the t"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"op-right of the web UI."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Use"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. Ask the agent to create or edit an `.html` file in the workspace. The plugin picks it up automati"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"cally.\n2. Click the top-right trigger to open the panel and choose a file; it loads in the embedded "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"editor.\n3. Edit in **Edit** mode, verify interactions in **Preview**, then **Save** to write back to"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"**Edit** mode, verify interactions in **Preview**, then **Save** to write back to the original file."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The plugin reuses a running local HTML Workbench service when one exists, or starts one in the backg"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"round — and stops the process it started when the plugin unloads. Everything stays on `127.0.0.1`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> **Development:** the plugin source lives in `dsh-plugin/`. Build its distributable artifacts (clie"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"nt bundle, bundled Python service, frontend) with `node dsh-plugin/build.mjs`, or `cd dsh-plugin && "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"led Python service, frontend) with `node dsh-plugin/build.mjs`, or `cd dsh-plugin && npm run build`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## What it solves"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- Avoid repeated chat-based requests such as “move this title down by 20 pixels.”\n- Skip scaffolding"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" a full frontend project for a single landing page.\n- Edit visually while preserving real page inter"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"actions in Preview mode.\n- Keep the service on local `127.0.0.1`; files are never exposed to the LAN"},{"id":"p19s4","text":".\n- Use revision checks to prevent an outdated editor state from overwriting changes made by AI or a"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"sion checks to prevent an outdated editor state from overwriting changes made by AI or another tool."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Recommended workflow"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"First create one self-contained HTML page with the tool of your choice, then open it in Workbench. K"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"eep its HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and required visual assets in one `.html` file, without a CDN or extr"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"a project directory. This makes the page easier to copy, open, edit, and share reliably."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Generate interactions according to the Workbench compatibility rules. Use stable semantic markers in"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"stead of relying on `nth-child`, DOM ancestry, or node ordering. The Skill checks these common risks"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" before opening the page."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"End users need Python 3.9 or later—no Node.js, npm, or pip packages."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Validate a newly created single-file page:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Then open it:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`open` is the only service command needed in normal use. It reuses a running local service when avai"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"lable, or starts one in the background when needed. Its JSON output contains the editor `url`; open "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"that URL in any browser. Agents with browser control can open it automatically."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Only use the following command when you explicitly want to manage a foreground service:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Edit and preview"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- **Edit mode**: Select elements, change text, replace images, adjust styles, and move content.\n- **"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"Preview mode**: Rebuild the page from the current unsaved edits so links, buttons, and page scripts "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"run as they would in a normal browser.\n- **Save**: Write changes safely to the original file. If it "},{"id":"p34s4","text":"changed on disk, Workbench stops rather than overwriting it."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## HTML Workbench Skill"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The distributable Skill lives in skill/html-workbench. When an Agent is also asked to create or edit"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" an HTML file, it guides this handoff:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"1. Generate a complete, single-file HTML page.\n2. Structure interactions according to the compatibil"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ity rules.\n3. Run the validator and fix errors.\n4. Reuse or start the service through `open`.\n5. Ret"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"urn a clickable editor URL and report whether the service was reused."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Read the generation guide and validation rules for details."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Development and packaging"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Source code stays in `service/`, `build/`, and `tests/`; the distributable Skill is maintained in `s"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"kill/html-workbench/`, and the DeepSeek Harness plugin in `dsh-plugin/`."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"The build bundles the workbench frontend into one `workbench.html` and copies the dependency-free Py"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"thon service and validator into the Skill. GrapesJS is downloaded at first service launch, hash-veri"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"fied, and cached locally. The download sequence prefers npmmirror, then falls back to other public s"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"ources; later launches can reuse the local cache offline."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
